 "brief": "Luay Abu Rida returned to his home in Qassra, south of Nablus, on Monday after time in the United States, only to discover it surrounded by settlers, Shehab Wire reported. The encirclement in the village occurred as Israeli military operations continued across the West Bank region.\n\nAbu Rida's return coincided with ongoing security operations by Israeli forces in the area. The circumstances surrounding how settlers came to surround his property and the current accessibility of his home remain unclear from available reports at this time.",
